'''Lightburst''' is a spell that creates a dazzling firework-like display of bright sparks from the user's hand that can dazzle and disorientate opponents. 

== History == 
[[Sophie Casterwill]] used this spell to disorientate two [[Suits]] in an underground cavern. {{Source|TCG:OAL-074|OAL-074}}

== Trivia ==
*This spell shares its name with [[Kipperin|Powerbonded Kipperin's]] ability, "Light Burst", which allows him to emit yellow energy to add power to an aerial tackle. {{Source|S2E30}}
